WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.695
Welcome to the Spatial Viewer. It is a 3D teaching hospital that opens

00:00:04.695 --> 00:00:09.140
right inside your Canvas page. Every lesson in this course has its own

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.272
room. Here is how to get around.

00:00:11.883 --> 00:00:14.970
On an activity page, click Start the 3D room.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.677
When it finishes loading, click Enter.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:22.100
You always begin in the corridor, right outside your room.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.797
In the top left corner is your task list.

00:00:24.797 --> 00:00:29.206
It shows the next thing to do. Tick the box when you finish a step.

00:00:29.206 --> 00:00:32.661
Along the top are your tools. We will try each one.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:36.863
To walk, use the W, A, S and D keys.

00:00:36.863 --> 00:00:41.736
W moves you forward. A and D step left and right.

00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:42.929
S backs up.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:47.954
To look around, hold the mouse button and drag, or use the arrow keys.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:51.465
To cross a room quickly, double-click the floor.

00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:53.448
You jump straight to that spot.

00:00:54.017 --> 00:00:57.288
Press R to float straight up, and F to come back down.

00:00:57.288 --> 00:01:00.963
Use this to read a high sign, or to see the top of a model.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:03.518
To pick something up, click it.

00:01:03.518 --> 00:01:05.931
A blue box shows what you are holding.

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:10.629
Walk, and it comes with you. Drag it onto the place where it belongs, then

00:01:10.629 --> 00:01:12.316
click it again to let go.

00:01:12.883 --> 00:01:17.165
When a room has labels or pieces to place, click Check answers.

00:01:17.165 --> 00:01:20.766
A green check means correct. A red X means try again.

00:01:20.766 --> 00:01:22.769
Click that piece for a hint.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:27.583
While you hold a piece, hold the right mouse button and drag to turn it.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:31.592
Hold the right mouse button and roll the wheel to make a piece bigger or

00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:32.074
smaller.

00:01:32.683 --> 00:01:35.810
Draw on model lets you draw right on a 3D model.

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:38.025
Pick a color, then press and drag.

00:01:38.025 --> 00:01:39.883
Click Done to stop drawing.

00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:44.270
Press N to add a sticky note. Type your answer and click Done.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.667
If you are standing at a board, the note sticks to it.

00:01:48.283 --> 00:01:51.132
To write on a board, click it and choose Draw.

00:01:51.132 --> 00:01:54.637
Save PNG saves a picture of the board to your computer.

00:01:55.283 --> 00:01:59.405
The menu has Save a screenshot, Record a video and Full screen.

00:01:59.405 --> 00:02:02.645
If you get lost, choose Back to where I started.

00:02:03.217 --> 00:02:05.572
Your work is kept in this browser only.

00:02:05.572 --> 00:02:09.679
Before you close the page, save your pictures and upload them to the

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:10.867
Canvas assignment.

00:02:11.483 --> 00:02:16.063
Now open the Spatial Viewer practice activity and try every tool yourself.
